<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Payment Receipt</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f8f6f2; color: #1b2a4a; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1b2a4a 0%, #2d4a7a 100%); padding: 40px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { color: #c49a2d; margin: 0; font-size: 28px; font-family: Georgia, serif; }
    .body { padding: 40px; }
    .receipt { background: #f8f6f2; border-radius: 8px; padding: 24px; }
    .receipt-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e0d8; font-size: 14px; }
    .receipt-row:last-child { border: none; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px; padding-top: 16px; }
    .footer { padding: 24px 40px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; border-top: 1px solid #f0f0f0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>✈ Starlings Hospitality</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <h2>Payment Received, {{firstName}}! 💳</h2>
      <p>Thank you for your payment. Here is your receipt:</p>
      <div class="receipt">
        <div class="receipt-row">
          <span>Reference</span>
          <span>{{reference}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="receipt-row">
          <span>Paid At</span>
          <span>{{paidAt}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="receipt-row">
          <span>Amount Paid</span>
          <span>₦{{amount}}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top:24px;">Your booking is now confirmed. Our travel consultants will be in touch shortly. Safe travels! ✈️</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>© 2024 Starlings Hospitality</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
